    "description": {
      "value": "<div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>You have studied languages and codes, gaining the following benefits:</p><div class=\"rd__spc-inline-post\"></div><ul class=\"rd__list\"><li class=\"rd__li \">Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li class=\"rd__li \">You learn three languages of your choice.</li><li class=\"rd__li \">You can ably create written ciphers. Others can't decipher a code you create unless you teach them, they succeed on an Intelligence check (DC equal to your Intelligence score + your proficiency bonus), or they use magic to decipher it.</li></ul></div>\n\t\t</div>",
